{"meta":{"id":"tt32199328","type":"series","name":"Newtopia","imdb_id":"tt32199328","description":"Jae-yoon, un soldado recluta, y su novia Young-joo terminan su relación tras una serie de malentendidos, justo cuando un apocalipsis zombi azota al mundo entero. Se declara la emergencia nacional, un avión se estrella en el corazón de Seúl y Jae-yoon queda atrapado en un rascacielos. Young-joo recorrerá las calles infestadas de zombis para encontrarlo. ¿Podrá su amor sobrevivir al apocalipsis?","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt32199328.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/olRPEYjyjzoMAODjOMjF2K1VlzO.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u02n5UaGbsryj5krKDch54XakgA.png","genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Action & Adventure","Comedia","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-02-07T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","runtime":"55 min","imdbRating":"6.6","country":"South Korea","cast":["박정민","지수","임성재","김준한","강영석","이학주","탕준상","홍서희","이주원","김정진","김상흔","박광재","권승우","박강섭","Bin Chan-uk","Lim Su-Bin","박미현","Lee Chan-hee","김찬형","Justin Chon","Bret Allan Lindquist","이주미","Chae Ja-woon","Lee Dan","Park Jae-gwan","Shin Dong-ho","한동원","차유주","김단비","이유주"],"director":["윤성현"],"writer":["한진원","Ji Ho-jin"],"trailers":[{"source":"HtaaO9D9ZcU","type":"Trailer","name":"Newtopia - Official Trailer | Prime Video","ytId":"HtaaO9D9ZcU","lang":"en"},{"source":"FwqXAxgTkA0","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"FwqXAxgTkA0","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"HtaaO9D9ZcU","title":"Newtopia - Official Trailer | Prime Video"},{"ytId":"FwqXAxgTkA0","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"6.6","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt32199328"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Sci-Fi+%26+Fantasy"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio://